sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Clin as Clinician
    participant IP as InpatientService
    participant Num as InpatientNumbering
    participant Ward as Ward/Bed Mgmt
    participant DB as Postgres
    participant Audit as AuditService

    Clin->>IP: Request admission (patientId, diagnosis, ward/bed preference)
    IP->>Num: Allocate admission number
    Num-->>IP: ADM-YYYY-NNNNNN
    IP->>DB: Create Admission (status PENDING/ADMITTED)
    IP->>Audit: audit admission.created
    Ward->>IP: Assign bed
    IP->>DB: Create BedAssignment, update Bed status to OCCUPIED
    IP->>DB: Update Admission status to ADMITTED
    IP->>Audit: audit admission.admitted
    Note over IP: Transfers create new BedAssignment; discharge updates bed status
    Ward->>IP: Discharge patient
    IP->>DB: Update BedAssignment end, update Bed status to AVAILABLE
    IP->>DB: Update Admission status to DISCHARGED
    IP->>Audit: audit admission.discharged
    Note over IP: Admission numbers via counters
